1
00:00:01,032 --> 00:00:02,112
You know your product.

2
00:00:02,312 --> 00:00:04,672
But what happens when someone sees it for the
first time?

3
00:00:05,432 --> 00:00:06,432
Meet Gnomi.

4
00:00:06,552 --> 00:00:08,592
Social simulation for product teams.

5
00:00:08,872 --> 00:00:10,872
Perspective before you ship.

6
00:00:11,352 --> 00:00:12,552
Start with your audience.

7
00:00:12,792 --> 00:00:17,072
Define the roles, languages, devices, and
goals that matter.

8
00:00:17,432 --> 00:00:20,952
Gnomi turns those differences into individual
simulated people.

9
00:00:21,432 --> 00:00:24,912
Share your idea, staging app,
or your Figma design.

10
00:00:25,432 --> 00:00:26,832
Set a goal and a budget.

11
00:00:27,192 --> 00:00:29,832
Each persona explores from
a different perspective.

12
00:00:30,152 --> 00:00:31,152
They click.

13
00:00:31,272 --> 00:00:32,272
They hesitate.

14
00:00:32,392 --> 00:00:33,432
They hit friction.

15
00:00:33,672 --> 00:00:38,032
And you can follow the actions, thoughts, and
evidence behind every step.

16
00:00:38,472 --> 00:00:40,232
Then the conversation starts.

17
00:00:40,552 --> 00:00:43,912
Personas post, reply, and react.

18
00:00:44,392 --> 00:00:47,472
One confusing experience can become a shared
opinion.

19
00:00:47,832 --> 00:00:50,752
Watch where it travels, and whose view
changes.

20
00:00:51,272 --> 00:00:53,232
Gnomi brings it together in a report:

21
00:00:53,512 --> 00:00:58,832
ranked potential frictions, affected
segments, screenshots, and quotes.

22
00:00:59,192 --> 00:01:03,112
See what happened, why it matters, and what
you could change.

23
00:01:03,592 --> 00:01:07,112
Projects run on your machine, with your own
model keys.

24
00:01:07,432 --> 00:01:10,112
Model inputs go to the provider you
configure.

25
00:01:10,552 --> 00:01:12,392
These are simulated findings.

26
00:01:12,872 --> 00:01:16,792
Use them as hypotheses, then validate
important decisions with real people.

27
00:01:17,512 --> 00:01:18,752
Find the friction.

28
00:01:19,112 --> 00:01:20,592
Follow the conversation.

29
00:01:20,952 --> 00:01:22,552
Know what to test next.

30
00:01:23,032 --> 00:01:24,032
Gnomi.
